<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Bing: site:sec.gov "Vulcan Elements" "Office of Strategic Capital"</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3asec.gov+%22Vulcan+Elements%22+%22Office+of+Strategic+Capital%22</link><description>Search results</description><image><url>http://www.bing.com:80/s/a/rsslogo.gif</url><title>site:sec.gov "Vulcan Elements" "Office of Strategic Capital"</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3asec.gov+%22Vulcan+Elements%22+%22Office+of+Strategic+Capital%22</link></image><copyright>Copyright © 2026 Microsoft. All rights reserved. These XML results may not be used, reproduced or transmitted in any manner or for any purpose other than rendering Bing results within an RSS aggregator for your personal, non-commercial use. Any other use of these results requires express written permission from Microsoft Corporation. By accessing this web page or using these results in any manner whatsoever, you agree to be bound by the foregoing restrictions.</copyright><item><title>Vulcan Materials Company</title><link>https://www.vulcanmaterials.com/</link><description>Vulcan is the leading supplier of aggregates in the United States, with unmatched, easily accessed reserves within a footprint that includes the nation’s high-growth markets.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 21:21:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vulcan Commercial Kitchen Equipment | Cooking Appliance Manufacturer</title><link>https://www.vulcanequipment.com/</link><description>At Vulcan, we produce top-quality, energy efficient professional kitchen equipment that consistently delivers spectacular results for restaurant and foodservice chefs and operators.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 10:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vulcan (mythology) - Wikipedia</title><link>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vulcan_(mythology)</link><description>Vulcan is a character in the Starz TV series American Gods, based on the novel by Neil Gaiman. He is not a character in the novel and is now the "god of guns" in this version, using the forge at his ammunition factory as a symbolic representation of a volcano.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 03:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vulcan: Defense and National Security Innovation Ecosystem</title><link>https://vulcan-sof.com/</link><description>Vulcan is a SaaS platform used to discover, evaluate, and transition capabilities that support the joint national security mission.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>MyVulcan</title><link>https://portal.myvulcan.com/</link><description>Take control of your Vulcan experience anytime, anywhere. Sign in to your MyVulcan profile.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 19:40:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vulcan | Memory Alpha | Fandom</title><link>https://memory-alpha.fandom.com/wiki/Vulcan</link><description>The Vulcans, or Vulcanians, [1] were a warp-capable humanoid species from the planet Vulcan. They were widely renowned for their strict adherence to logic and reason as well as their remarkable stoicism. In 2161, their homeworld became a founding member of the United Federation of Planets.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:21:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vulcan (Star Trek) - Wikipedia</title><link>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vulcan_(Star_Trek)</link><description>Vulcans are a fictional extraterrestrial humanoid species in the Star Trek media franchise. They are noted for their strict adherence to logic and reason and suppression of emotion. Known for their pronounced eyebrows and pointed ears, they originate from the fictional planet Vulcan.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:14:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vulcan Food Equipment Sales Distributors | Find Kitchen Equipment ...</title><link>https://www.vulcanequipment.com/sales</link><description>Vulcan, the world’s leading commercial kitchen equipment manufacturer has sales professionals and distributors worldwide, ready to assist you with your Vulcan equipment needs. Search for a Vulcan sales rep in your area.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 10:08:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Our Company - vulcanmaterials.com</title><link>https://www.vulcanmaterials.com/our-company</link><description>For more than a century, Vulcan has built a legacy rooted in growth, adaptability, and responsibility. While the company has evolved through expansion and change, our focus on long-term value and stewardship has remained constant. We prioritize employee safety, growth, and opportunity.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Home | Vulkan | Cross platform 3D Graphics</title><link>https://www.vulkan.org/</link><description>Vulkan is a cross-platform industry standard enabling developers to target a wide range of devices with the same graphics API. Vulkan is constantly evolving to bring new capabilities and improvements to the API. Here are some of the most recent developments. Vulkan is constantly evolving to bring new capabilities and improvements to the API.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 21:06:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>